 "notes": [
  "goldmine-self corpus files are snapshot-pinned under evals/corpus_snapshot/ ('origin' holds the live path); the index and the labels consume the snapshot, so dev-day edits cannot rot them \u2014 refresh the manifest deliberately to move the snapshot",
  "fixture files marked 'requires' (say/ffmpeg) are existence-checked only; the say wav additionally pins a content-stable surrogate (tool + transcript + duration bucket \u2014 its raw bytes are environment-dependent)",
  "fixture 'version' record (version + generator content hash + file count) is a corpus_sha input: a regenerated fixture invalidates loudly",
  "scripts/eval_relevance.py and docs/TEST_PLAN.md are excluded from the index \u2014 they quote the noise-query strings (self-leak, F6)",
  "v6 2026-10-25 (ocr-restore-001, D4-pattern source-data fix): the scanned pages of atlas-hybrid.pdf/atlas-scanned.pdf regenerated with receipt/chart-realistic rendered text (8 lines/page at line_gap_rows=4) so Vision OCR recovers 233-254 chars/page \u2014 pdf_evidence now records info.ocr_pages and the six needs:ocr preflight items (media-045..050) close. Raster pages still carry no text layer; no product code, label or denominator change."
 ]
